@dodecahedra @singerng_ @udi256 I have two proofs in my text https://t.co/8gLbXfpM9d

1) Diagonalization to show existence of some uncomputable function F* + reduction F* to HALT

2) Direct proof following Christopher Strachey's recollection of a verbal proof by Turing. https://t.co/uIT2zz666S

@udi256 Several other videos on @udi256 's website, including, sorting algorithms, the "kernel trick", special relativity, Bell's inequality, and more. 

https://t.co/AiV6VfhSUH

https://t.co/4z2woIkaMo

